90859728115,"date":"2026-10-01","time":"7:02 PM","iso":"2026-10-01T13:02:08.115Z","content":"Amer to na gf ase na bf ase tumi i aso","type":"text","reactions":[],"sourceFile":"s_27446236815041740/message_1.json#p1"},{"id":"m_1790859915142_NIHAN","sender":"NIHAN","senderDisplay":"NIHAN","threadId":"s_27446236815041740","threadTitle":"Sumaiya","timestamp":1790859915142,"date":"2026-10-01","time":"7:05 PM","iso":"2026-10-01T13:05:15.142Z","content":"You sent an attachment.","type":"share","shareType":"post","shareLink":"https://www.instagram.com/p/Dd2moXCvjxu/","shareText":"A genuine compliment is one of the rarest and most valuable things a person can give. In a world full of fake friendships, backhanded comments, and people who only hype you up when it benefits them, a girl who gives honest compliments stands out immediately. When a compliment comes from a place of real confidence and real love, you can feel the difference. There is no hidden jealousy in it, no competition behind it, and no performance for attention.\n\nGirls who compliment other girls freely are girls who are secure in themselves. They understand that calling another woman beautiful does not take anything away from their own beauty. In fact, it does the opposite. It builds trust, it builds sisterhood, and it creates the kind of friendships where women actually feel safe around each other. So many girls have trust issues with female friendships because they have experienced the fake smiles and the quiet comparisons. A sincere compliment is proof that not every girl is like that.\n\nSo if a girl like this tells you that you are pretty, believe her the first time. She does not say it for show, she does not say it to everyone, and she definitely does not say things she does not mean. Take the compliment, let it land, and pass that same honest energy on to the next girl. Real recognizes real, and genuine girls always find each other.","reactions":[{"reaction":"❤","actor":"SUMAIYA","actorDisplay":"SUMAIYA